@startuml
title Diagram 7.2: Evolved Hybrid Architecture — VPC Cloud + Isolated Sensitive Data Enclave
skinparam backgroundColor #F3F6FB
skinparam defaultFontName "Liberation Sans"
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #1F3A5F
skinparam ArrowFontColor #1F3A5F
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.6
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam RoundCorner 6
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam componentFontColor #1F3A5F
skinparam componentFontStyle bold
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #EAF0F8
skinparam nodeBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam nodeFontColor #1F3A5F
skinparam nodeFontStyle bold
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam databaseBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F3F6FB
skinparam packageBorderColor #000000
skinparam packageBorderThickness 2
skinparam packageFontSize 15
skinparam packageFontStyle bold
skinparam cloudBackgroundColor #F3F6FB
skinparam cloudBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #1F3A5F
skinparam noteFontName "Liberation Mono"
skinparam noteFontSize 11
skinparam noteFontColor #5A6B85
skinparam fileBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam fileBorderColor #1F3A5F

package "<&key> Corporate On-Premises Environment" as onprem {
  node "AWS Nitro Enclave / Intel SGX\n(Strict Perimeter Firewall)" as enclave {
    database "PII Storage\n(AES-GCM-256 Encrypted)" as pii
    component "Sync Agent\n(Unidirectional Controller)" as sync
  }
}
note top of pii
**Sensitive Data Enclave:**
• Physical isolation of cryptographic keys.
• Zero-trust ingestion: strictly inbound flow.
• Real-time auditing connected to the corporate SIEM.
• Strict compliance: GDPR, HIPAA, PCI-DSS.
end note

file "<&lock-locked> IPSec / WireGuard Tunnel\n(mTLS with SPIFFE/SPIRE)\nIntegrity: HMAC-SHA256\nKey Rotation: Ephemeral (PFS)" as tunnel
note bottom of tunnel
**Cryptographic Transport Layer:**
• End-to-end channel encryption (E2EE).
• Zero-Trust: continuous cryptographic identity verification.
• Native support for Perfect Forward Secrecy (PFS).
end note

package "<&cloud> Corporate Public Cloud (VPC)" as cloud {
  node "VPC (Virtual Private Cloud)\nCIDR Block: 10.0.0.0/16" as vpc {
    package "<&lock-locked> Private Subnet 1: Agent Compute" as s1 {
      component "Autonomous Agent Pod #1\n(Isolated via NetworkPolicy)" as pod1
      component "Autonomous Agent Pod #2\n(Pod IAM Identity)" as pod2
    }
    package "<&lock-locked> Private Subnet 2: Orchestration" as s2 {
      component "Event Bus\n(Apache Kafka Cluster)" as bus
      component "Stream Processor\n(Kafka Streams/Flink Engine)" as proc
    }
    node "NAT Gateway\n(Egress with Fixed Static IP)" as nat
    package "<&lock-locked> Private Subnet 3: Transient Data" as s3 {
      database "Distributed Cache\n(Redis Cluster Sharded)" as cache
      database "Immutable Data Lake\n(Apache Iceberg + Parquet)" as lake
    }
  }
}
note left of pod1
**Zero-Trust Network Policies:**
• Inbound traffic denied by default (Deny-All).
• Dynamic secrets injection via HashiCorp Vault.
• Logical isolation of execution threads in real time.
end note
note right of bus
**Event Bus Topology:**
• Strict delivery guarantee: At-least-once.
• Log compaction enabled for historical audits.
• Partitioning by Aggregate Key for ordering.
end note
note right of lake
**Data Lake Governance:**
• Open and structured format (Apache Iceberg).
• Integrated time-travel query support.
• Automated lifecycle: cold storage after 30 days.
end note

cloud "External Edge Services" as edge {
  component "Observability Platform\n(Metrics Ingestion / OpenTelemetry)" as obs
  component "External LLM Provider\n(Dedicated Endpoint / PrivateLink)" as llm
  component "Code Repository\n(Secured CI/CD Git)" as repo
}

lake -[hidden]left-> cache
pii --> tunnel : Encrypted Queries\n(Dynamic Tokenization)
sync --> tunnel : Delta Change Pull\n(CRON Interval: 5 min)
tunnel --> pod1 : Synchronized Data\n(Decrypted in Memory)
tunnel --> pod2 : Asynchronous Replication\n(Eventual Consistency)
pod1 --> bus : evt:AgentReady\n(uuidv4_correlation_id)
pod2 --> bus : evt:TaskStart\n(ISO 8601 UTC Standard)
pod1 --> nat : Secure HTTPS Egress\n(Rate Limit: 100 req/s)
pod2 --> nat : Infrastructure Tracing\n(Statistical Sampling: 10%)
bus --> proc : Continuous Stream Consumption\n(Controlled Offset Commits)
proc --> cache : Write-Through Operations\n(TTL Monitoring / LRU Eviction)
proc --> lake : Append-Only\n(Daily Partitioning by Schema)
proc ..> obs : Anonymized Telemetry\n(Data Masking / OTel)
nat --> llm : Outbound Traffic\n(Strict IP/FQDN Filtering)
obs ..> repo : Webhook Trigger\n(Metric Drift Alerts)
@enduml
